Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm always being honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}so we'll get to that point.
