Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So I'm saying that every time a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}celebrity does something, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}その話はまたするとして
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}セレブが人前で何かすると　毎回それは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}in the public, it's, you know, to raise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}their profile or something, some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}自分の評判を上げるためだって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}言われるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, I'm here, right?
