Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But I would love for people to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}understand my perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも俺の視点を
