Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of you up before the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}人前で最高の自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}出すためにな
